>> title: Cheese Grits
>> category: Rice, Beans & Grains
>> tags: grits, cheddar, southern, breakfast, stovetop
>> counters: Meat and Three, Diner
>> aka: grits, stone-ground grits, cheesy grits
>> pairs-with: sausage-gravy
>> servings: 6
>> time: 45 min

>> step: simmer
Bring @water{3%cups}(710 mL), @whole milk{2%cups}(480 mL), and @kosher salt{1 1/2%tsp} to a simmer in a #heavy saucepan{}.

>> step: whisk in
Whisk @stone-ground grits{1%cup}(170 g) into @&(~1)hot milk{} in a slow steady stream.

>> step: cook covered 35 min
Cook @&(~1)grits{} covered over low heat for ~{35%min}, stirring every few minutes so they do not catch.

>> step: beat in off the heat
Beat @sharp cheddar{6%oz}(170 g; grated), @unsalted butter{3%Tbs}, @hot sauce{1/2%tsp}, and @black pepper{1/2%tsp} into @&(~1)grits{} off the heat.
